    "detailed_description": "This game is a highly difficult mountain climbing physics action game.<br>All you need to do is one click and force roll.<br>Its maneuvers make it difficult to climb and it is a very tough road to reach the end point.<br>But if you don't give up, you'll definitely get there<br><br><br><br>This is a story about a moon that fell from the sky.<br><br>You must operate the moon's &quot;Koromun&quot; to climb a steep mountain and return to where you came from.<br>However, the round moon Koromun cannot perform actions such as jumping, and can only roll as hard as he can.<br>Climbing is difficult, and once you fall down a mountain, even stopping is not easy.<br>I'm sure you'll fall and be brought back down many times.<br>Still, Koromun has to climb.<br>To return to the moon that illuminates the darkness of the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distribution guidelines</h2>Monetization distribution is possible for individuals and corporations without permission.<br>Please include the title of this game in your video, broadcast title, or thumbnail.<br>This is optional, but we would appreciate it if you could include the URL of this game's Steam store in the description.<br>We are not responsible for any damage caused by distributing videos of this game.<br>The contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
